{
  "name": "ACTA PRO | 06 - Meeting Transcription",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WORKFLOW 06 — Meeting Transcription\n\nWebhook incremental: acepta fragmentos de audio (base64 o binary) durante la reunión, uno por uno, sin esperar a que termine toda la reunión. Envía cada fragmento a un servicio Speech-to-Text (placeholder OpenAI Whisper) y guarda el texto resultante junto con meeting_id, timestamp y confidence.\n\nCONFIGURAR: credencial del servicio STT (OpenAI u otro configurable) y destino de almacenamiento (Postgres/Sheets).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "uzo0ouxh8cto9gx1",
      "name": "Nota - vzqo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "acta-pro/audio-chunk",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "binaryData": true
        }
      },
      "id": "jhe2os4dkwbweo87",
      "name": "Webhook /audio-chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "meeting_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.meeting_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "chunk_timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.timestamp }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "expected_participants",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.participantes_esperados || $json.body.participants }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
